return {h=6,w=75,cr=150,hc=10,bh=140,gr="fast",eg={"fairy"},st={70,45,48,60,65,35},ab={{56,0},{98,0},{132,1}},genus={en="Fairy Pokémon",es="Pokémon Hada",pt="Pokémon Fada"},flavor={en={[1]="Its magical and cute appeal has many admirers. It is rare and found only in certain areas.",[2]="Its magical and cute appeal has many admirers. It is rare and found only in certain areas.",[3]="Adored for their cute looks and playfulness. They are thought to be rare, as they do not appear often.",[4]="The moonlight that it stores in the wings on its back apparently gives it the ability to float in midair.",[5]="Its adorable behavior and cry make it highly popular. However, this cute Pokémon is rarely found.",[6]="Though rarely seen, it becomes easier to spot, for some reason, on the night of a full moon.",[7]="On every night of a full moon, groups of this Pokémon come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired CLEFAIRY return to their quiet mountain retreats and go to sleep nestled up against each other.",[8]="On every night of a full moon, groups of this Pokémon come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired CLEFAIRY return to their quiet mountain retreats and go to sleep nestled up against each other.",[9]="On every night of a full moon, they come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired CLEFAIRY go to sleep nestled up against each other in deep and quiet mountains.",[10]="Its adorable appearance makes it popular as a pet. However, it is rare and difficult to find.",[11]="With its magical and cute appeal, it has many admirers. It is rare and found only in certain areas.",[12]="Thought to live with others on quiet mountains, it is popular for its adorable nature.",[13]="It flies using the wings on its back to collect moonlight. This Pokémon is difficult to find.",[14]="It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of CLEFAIRY dancing under a full moon.",[15]="The moonlight that it stores in the wings on its back apparently gives it the ability to float in midair.",[16]="Its adorable behavior and cry make it highly popular. However, this cute Pokémon is rarely found.",[17]="It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.",[18]="It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.",[21]="On nights with a full moon, Clefairy gather from all over and dance. Bathing in moonlight makes them float.",[22]="On nights with a full moon, Clefairy gather from all over and dance. Bathing in moonlight makes them float.",[23]="It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.",[24]="The moonlight that it stores in the wings on its back apparently gives it the ability to float in midair.",[25]="On every night of a full moon, groups of this Pokémon come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired Clefairy return to their quiet mountain retreats and go to sleep nestled up against each other.",[26]="On every night of a full moon, groups of this Pokémon come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired Clefairy return to their quiet mountain retreats and go to sleep nestled up against each other.",[27]="Its adorable behavior and appearance make it popular with men and women, young and old. Its numbers are few, however.",[28]="On nights with a full moon, they gather together and dance. The surrounding area is enveloped in an abnormal magnetic field.",[29]="They’re popular, but they’re rare. Trainers who show them off recklessly may be targeted by thieves.",[30]="Bathed in moonlight, its wings glow faintly. Without even flapping, Clefairy rises into the air, where it dances around.",[31]="Adored for their cute looks and playfulness. They are thought to be rare, as they do not appear often.",[32]="Adored for their cute looks and playfulness. They are thought to be rare, as they do not appear often.",[33]="It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.",[34]="Its adorable behavior and cry make it highly popular. However, this cute Pokémon is rarely found.",[39]="It can be found in quiet mountain areas on a full moon's night. Its dancing and its tiny, faintly glowing wings confer upon it a lovely fairylike quality."},es={[23]="Se dice que la felicidad llegará a quien vea a un grupo de Clefairy bailando a la luz de la luna llena.",[24]="La luz de luna que guarda en las alas de su lomo parece darle la habilidad de flotar en el aire.",[25]="Siempre que hay luna llena, salen en grupo para jugar. Al amanecer, los Clefairy, agotados, regresan a sus refugios de montaña para dormir acurrucados unos con otros.",[26]="Siempre que hay luna llena, salen en grupo para jugar. Al amanecer, los Clefairy, agotados, regresan a sus refugios de montaña para dormir acurrucados unos con otros.",[27]="Tanto niños como adultos de todas las edades los encuentran adorables por su aspecto y su comportamiento. No quedan muchos ejemplares.",[28]="Cuando hay luna llena, los Clefairy salen en grupo a bailar. A su alrededor se genera un misterioso campo magnético.",[29]="Es muy popular y la escasez de ejemplares lo hace muy valioso. Quien presume mucho de tener uno se arriesga a que se lo roben.",[30]="Cuando la luz de la luna baña sus alas, estas emiten un tenue brillo y, sin batirlas siquiera, levita en el aire y comienza a bailar.",[31]="Su aspecto jovial y sus ademanes lo hacen adorable y muy popular, aunque no suelen verse a menudo, tal vez porque su número sea escaso.",[32]="Su aspecto jovial y sus ademanes lo hacen adorable y muy popular, aunque no suelen verse a menudo, tal vez porque su número sea escaso.",[33]="Se dice que la felicidad llegará a quien vea un grupo de Clefairy bailando a la luz de la luna llena.",[34]="Su adorable grito y comportamiento lo hacen muy popular. Sin embargo, raramente se avista."},pt="Pode ser encontrado em áreas tranquilas das montanhas em noites de lua cheia. Sua dança e suas asinhas de brilho suave lhe dão um belo ar de fada."},evo={{s=173},{s=35,from=173,c={{t="level-up",happy=160}}},{s=36,from=35,c={{t="use-item",item=81}}}},moves={[1]={1,1,1,45,13,47,18,3,24,107,31,118,39,111,48,113},[2]={1,1,1,45,13,47,18,3,24,107,31,118,39,111,48,113},[3]={1,1,1,45,4,227,8,47,13,3,19,107,26,111,34,118,43,236,53,113},[4]={1,1,1,45,4,227,8,47,13,3,19,107,26,111,34,118,43,236,53,113},[5]={1,1,1,45,5,227,9,47,13,3,17,266,21,107,25,111,29,118,33,322,37,236,41,113,45,309},[6]={1,1,1,45,5,227,9,47,13,3,17,266,21,107,25,111,29,118,33,322,37,236,41,113,45,309},[7]={1,1,1,45,5,227,9,47,13,3,17,266,21,107,25,111,29,118,33,322,37,236,41,113,45,309},[8]={1,1,1,45,4,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,107,22,358,25,322,28,381,31,118,34,356,37,236,40,113,43,309,46,361},[9]={1,1,1,45,4,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,107,22,358,25,322,28,381,31,118,34,356,37,236,40,113,43,309,46,361},[10]={1,1,1,45,4,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,107,22,358,25,322,28,381,31,118,34,356,37,236,40,113,43,309,46,361},[11]={1,1,1,45,4,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,107,22,358,25,516,28,322,31,381,34,118,37,356,40,236,43,500,46,113,49,361,52,495,55,309},[12]={1,1,1,45,5,227,9,47,13,3,17,266,21,107,25,111,29,118,33,322,37,236,41,113,45,309},[13]={1,1,1,45,5,227,9,47,13,3,17,266,21,107,25,111,29,118,33,322,37,236,41,113,45,309},[14]={1,1,1,45,4,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,516,22,358,25,107,28,500,31,118,34,322,37,381,40,34,43,236,46,113,49,356,52,309,55,361,58,495},[15]={1,495,1,361,1,574,1,1,1,45,1,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,516,22,358,25,107,28,500,31,118,34,322,37,381,40,34,43,236,46,585,49,356,50,309,55,361,58,495},[16]={1,495,1,361,1,574,1,1,1,45,1,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,516,22,358,25,107,28,500,31,118,34,322,37,381,40,34,43,236,46,585,49,356,50,309,55,361,58,495},[17]={1,671,1,574,1,1,1,45,1,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,516,22,358,25,107,28,500,31,118,34,322,37,381,40,34,43,236,46,585,49,356,50,309,55,361,58,495},[18]={1,671,1,574,1,1,1,45,1,227,7,47,10,3,13,111,16,266,19,516,22,358,